This subdirectory contains the project web pages.

Build them with AsciiDoctor (the asciidoctor command, or a versioned
name such as asciidoctor34):

    scons www

SCons writes the pages under the versioned build directory,
gpsd-$VERSION/www/. It also symlinks that directory as buildtmp, so
the same tree is buildtmp/www/.

Publish a local copy with:

    scons website

That rsyncs buildtmp/www/ to the directory named by the WEBSITE
environment variable, or to .public when WEBSITE is unset. The
GitLab Pages job sets WEBSITE=.public, runs scons website, and moves
.public to public. See the pages job in .gitlab-ci.yml.
